# How a run ends, and what a failure leaves behind

Every run ends with exactly one turn-ending comment on the issue or pull request
it worked on. It is how the thread learns the turn is over — the guard reads it,
not the Actions tab — and the footer, the run link and the token count, is
written onto it.

