A run with no ending on the thread leaves the thread's last event saying the
ball is still with an agent — so the guard keeps removing what follows it, and
comments start vanishing with no run ever arriving. That shape is the signal:
a run died without writing its ending.

The restore is the same for every kind of death. **Re-run the failed run** —
"Re-run failed jobs" on the run, or `gh workflow run atomaton-runner.yml -f
number=N -f agent=X` by hand — and it resumes from the saved session and writes
